var e={" along the ridge the trim line left":`，沿修边线留下的凸棱`," along the trim line":`，沿修边线`," and the feet":`和底脚`,"+ Funnel":`+ 漏斗`,"+ Key":`+ 定位键`,"+ Logo (SVG)":`+ 标志 (SVG)`,"+ Pillar":`+ 支柱`,"+ Split plane":`+ 分模面`,"+ Text":`+ 文字`,"+ Vent":`+ 排气孔`,"+ Volume label":`+ 用量标签`,", with the core standing through the base plate":`，型芯穿过底板立着`,"0 for none":`0 表示无`,"0° tilts toward +X, 90° toward +Y":`0° 向 +X 倾斜，90° 向 +Y 倾斜`,"1 (one piece)":`1（整体）`,"2 sides":`2 侧`,"2 sides + base":`2 侧 + 底`,"2-Part Silicone":`两件式硅胶模`,"2-Part Tray Mold":`两件式托盘模`,"3 pads":`3 个垫脚`,"3D model → printable mold system, entirely in your browser":`3D 模型 → 可打印的模具系统，全部在浏览器中完成`,"3MF, all parts on one plate":`3MF，所有零件放在一块板上`,"4 pads":`4 个垫脚`,"4 sides":`4 侧`,"4 sides + base":`4 侧 + 底`,"6 sides":`6 侧`,"6 sides + base":`6 侧 + 底`,"8 sides":`8 侧`,"8 sides + base":`8 侧 + 底`,"; the finger notches let you lift them out again":`；借助指槽可以再把它们取出来`,"A cutter from the model’s outline seen from above, with an optional stamp for its top relief.":`根据从上方看到的模型轮廓生成的切模，可选印章用于印出顶面浮雕。`,"A flange round the split with bolt holes, so the mold stays shut while it turns":`分模处一圈带螺栓孔的法兰，让模具在旋转时保持闭合`,"A flat rim round the split to hold and press the halves":`分模处一圈平边，用来握持并压紧两半`,"A groove around the cast where the spare is cut off":`铸件周围的一道槽，冒口从这里切掉`,"A groove round the cavity’s edge that takes the excess when the overfilled halves are pressed together":`型腔边缘外的一道槽，在两半装得过满并压合时容纳多余的料`,"A hinge along the long side; the shell prints lying open, in one piece":`沿长边的铰链；外壳以展开状态整体打印`,"A mold straight off the printer for resin, plaster or wax. Sand the cavity, use mold release, and turn on Clear extraction where undercuts hold the halves.":`直接打印的模具，适用于树脂、石膏或蜡。打磨型腔、使用脱模剂，并在倒扣卡住两半的地方开启“自由脱模”。`,"A plaster mold is filled with casting slip (pick Custom for your slip’s density).":`石膏模中注入泥浆（泥浆密度请选择“自定义”）。`,"A plate under the mold with slotted holes to bolt it to the rotocaster frame":`模具下方的板，带长圆孔，用于用螺栓固定到旋转浇铸机的框架上`,"A pour hole at the top":`顶部的浇注孔`,"A printed cradle that holds the flipped mold in shape while you cast":`打印的托架，浇注时让翻转的模具保持形状`,"A registration key crosses the pour funnel or a vent; move it.":`一个定位键穿过浇注漏斗或排气孔；请移动它。`,"A registration key crosses the seal ring; move it outward.":`有定位键穿过密封环；请把它往外移。`,"A registration key cuts into the model; move it away from it.":`一个定位键切入了模型；请把它移离模型。`,"A registration key sticks out of the mold; move it inward.":`一个定位键伸出了模具；请把它向内移动。`,"A reservoir above the piece that keeps the slip topped up; it is trimmed off afterwards":`铸件上方的储料口，保持泥浆充满；之后会被修掉`,"A round hole and a slot for dowel pins in the machine bed: the plate goes back in exactly the same place":`机床台面上定位销用的一个圆孔和一个长圆孔：底板每次都能准确回到同一位置`,"A rounded foot where the buck meets the plinth, so the sheet neither webs nor tears there":`阳模与底座相接处的圆角，让片材在那里不起皱也不撕裂`,"A silicone jacket releases undercuts and fine detail; the shell keeps it in shape":`硅胶外套能脱出倒扣和细节；外壳保持它的形状`,"A silicone mold in as many pieces as the model needs to come out, poured one after another against printed dams.":`按模型脱模所需分成多块的硅胶模，依次靠着打印的占位块浇注。`,"A slight taper that eases the core out of the cast":`轻微的锥度，让型芯更容易从铸件中取出`,"A slot from each pocket out through one side, for tools, cables or sliding the object in":`从每个穴位穿过一侧通向外面的槽，用于工具、线缆或把物件滑入`,"A solid, flat base under the model’s underside. Lay the model flat on the face you want as its bottom first.":`模型底面下方的实心平底座。请先把模型放平在你想作为底面的那一面上。`,"A tongue and groove all round the cavity, so the material can’t seep out between the rigid halves":`型腔四周一圈凸榫和凹槽，让材料不会从两个硬质半模之间渗出`,Access:`取放`,"Adapted Box":`随形盒`,"Add casting sprues":`添加浇道`,"Adding the labels…":`正在添加标签…`,Adjust:`调整`,Advanced:`高级`,Aggressive:`激进`,"Air vents":`排气孔`,"Air-trap pillars":`气穴支柱`,"Alignment keys (tape or strap it shut)":`定位键（用胶带或绑带封住）`,"Alignment pins + clamps":`定位销 + 夹具`,"Amounts include {n} % extra for mixing and spills. Check your product’s data sheet for its density and mix ratio.":`用量已包含 {n} % 的混合和损耗余量。密度和混合比例请查看产品技术资料。`,"An SVG file: its filled shapes and lines are used":`SVG 文件：会使用其中的填充形状和线条`,"Angle of the split plane from horizontal":`分模面与水平面的夹角`,"Angled plane":`倾斜平面`,"Assembly & pouring":`组装与浇注`,"At an angle":`倾斜`,"At the bottom of recesses and round the foot, so the vacuum pulls the sheet into them":`在凹处底部和底脚一圈，让真空把片材吸进去`,"At the cutting edge":`在刃口处`,"Auto parting height":`自动分模高度`,Automatic:`自动`,"Automatic (the fewest cuts that free the cast)":`自动（能取出铸件的最少切割）`,"Automatic adds pieces where undercuts would hold the cast; 4 to 8 sides stand round the model for ribs and flutes":`“自动”会在倒扣会卡住铸件的地方增加零件；遇到筋条或凹槽时，4 到 8 个侧块围在模型四周`,"Automatic makes one piece when the cast comes straight out of it":`铸件能直接取出时，“自动”只做一件`,"Automatic makes one piece when the cast lifts straight out of it":`铸件能直接向上提起时，“自动”只做一件`,"Automatic uses the model’s own inside when it is open at the top":`模型顶部开口时，“自动”使用模型自身的内腔`,"Automatic uses the rim when the model is open at the top":`模型顶部开口时，“自动”使用口沿`,Back:`返回`,"Back (+Y)":`后 (+Y)`,"Back (second pour)":`背面（第二次浇注）`,Balanced:`均衡`,Base:`底部`,"Base channel depth":`底板槽深`,"Base plate":`底板`,"Base plate thickness":`底板厚度`,"Bath Bomb Mold":`浴球模具`,"Bath bomb":`浴球`,"Bath bomb mix (packed)":`浴球料（压实）`,"Below (sprue beside the model)":`从下方（浇道在模型旁边）`,"Blade height":`刃高`,"Blade thickness":`刃厚`,Bobbin:`线轴`,"Bolt hole Ø":`螺栓孔 Ø`,"Bolt holes":`螺栓孔`,"Bolt size":`螺栓规格`,"Bolt the mount plate to the rotocaster frame.":`用螺栓把安装板固定到旋转浇铸机的框架上。`,"Bolted flanges":`螺栓法兰`,Bolts:`螺栓`,"Bolts over 200 mm long are hard to find: use threaded rod with a nut and washer at each end.":`长于 200 mm 的螺栓不好买：改用螺杆，两端各加一个螺母和垫圈。`,"Bottom half":`下半部`,Box:`盒子`,"Box shape":`盒子形状`,"Box wall":`盒壁`,"Box wall {letter}":`盒壁 {letter}`,"Brush mold release onto the silicone’s parting face. Second pour: mix {amount} and pour the back up to the walls’ edge. Let it cure.":`在硅胶的分模面上刷脱模剂。第二次浇注：混合 {amount}，把背面浇到盒壁边缘。等待固化。`,"Brush the silicone onto the model in layers until it is about {mm} mm thick (or pour it into the closed shell around the model), then cut the jacket open along the split lines.":`将硅胶分层刷在模型上，直到约 {mm} mm 厚（或把它浇进模型周围闭合的外壳里），然后沿分模线切开外套。`,Buck:`阳模`,"Buck size":`阳模尺寸`,Bucket:`桶`,"Bucket part {n}":`桶件 {n}`,"Bucket parts":`桶件`,"Bucket wall":`桶壁`,"Building the {system} parts…":`正在生成 {system} 的零件…`,Cancel:`取消`,"Case for {piece}: clips":`{piece}的外箱：卡扣`,"Case for {piece}: floor":`{piece}的外箱：底`,"Case for {piece}: wall {letter}":`{piece}的外箱：壁 {letter}`,"Case for {piece}: {part}":`{piece}的外箱：{part}`,"Case silicone thickness":`外箱硅胶模厚度`,"Case wall":`外箱壁`,"Case walls for sides {letters}: clips":`侧块 {letters} 共用的外箱壁：卡扣`,"Case walls for sides {letters}: wall {letter}":`侧块 {letters} 共用的外箱壁：壁 {letter}`,Cast:`铸件`,"Cast hollow (core)":`空心浇注（型芯）`,"Cast solid":`实心浇注`,"Cast wall":`铸件壁`,"Cast wall thickness":`铸件壁厚`,"Cast {ml} ml":`铸件 {ml} ml`,Casting:`浇注`,"Casting box":`浇注盒`,"Casting material":`浇注材料`,"Casting slip (clay)":`注浆泥浆（黏土）`,"Casting support":`浇注支撑`,"Casting volume":`浇注体积`,"Casting volume (model)":`浇注体积（模型）`,"Casting volume incl. sprue & vents":`浇注体积（含浇道和排气孔）`,"Casts a vessel with its inside: a bucket for the outside and a core, hanging from a lid, for the inside.":`连同内腔一起浇注器皿：桶负责外面，挂在盖子上的型芯负责里面。`,"Cavity layer step":`型腔层步`,Ceramics:`陶瓷`,"Channels from air traps under overhangs out to the opening":`从悬垂下方的气穴通向开口的通道`,"Check that the vent holes are open (a {d} mm drill clears them) and set the buck on the vacuum table.":`检查排气孔是否通畅（用 {d} mm 钻头可清通），然后把阳模放到真空台上。`,"Checked when the mold is generated.":`生成模具时检查。`,"Checking & repairing {n} triangles…":`正在检查并修复 {n} 个三角形…`,"Checking that every part comes off…":`正在检查每个零件能否脱出…`,Chocolate:`巧克力`,"Choose a file":`选择文件`,"Choose…":`选择…`,"Clamp flange width":`夹紧法兰宽度`,"Clamp the parts together, turn the mold over and pour through the opening; then take the parts off the cast.":`把零件夹在一起，翻转模具，从开口浇注；然后把零件从铸件上取下。`,"Clay (pressed)":`黏土（压制）`,"Clear extraction (remove undercuts)":`自由脱模（去除倒扣）`,"Click a face in the view…":`在视图中点击一个面…`,"Click a handle in the view to select it. What you haven’t moved keeps following the parameters.":`在视图中点击手柄以选中它。你没移动过的部分会继续跟随参数。`,"Click on a mold part or on the master where the label goes (Esc cancels).":`点击模具零件或母模上要放标签的位置（Esc 取消）。`,"Click on a split plane to place the key (Esc cancels).":`点击分模面放置定位键（Esc 取消）。`,"Click on a split plane to place the key.":`点击分模面放置定位键。`,"Click on the model to place it.":`点击模型进行放置。`,"Click on the model to place the funnel (Esc cancels).":`点击模型放置漏斗（Esc 取消）。`,"Click on the model to place the pillar (Esc cancels).":`点击模型放置支柱（Esc 取消）。`,"Click on the model to place the vent (Esc cancels).":`点击模型放置排气孔（Esc 取消）。`,"Clip grip":`卡扣夹紧度`,Clips:`卡扣`,"Close openings up to":`封闭开口，最大`,"Close the halves again (the keys line them up), back up, and pour {cast} through the sprue per cast.":`重新合上两半（定位键会对齐），背面朝上，每次浇注从浇道倒入 {cast}。`,"Close the halves again (the keys line them up), hold them in the box or with rubber bands, and pour {cast} through the funnel per cast.":`重新合上两半（定位键会对齐），用盒子或橡皮筋固定，每次浇注从漏斗倒入 {cast}。`,"Closed mold for hollow casts made by turning a little material around inside it, with a plugged fill port and a mount plate.":`用于空心铸件的闭合模具：在里面转动少量材料成型，带可封堵的注料口和安装板。`,"Closed silicone mold in a tray: the model stands on a spacer for the first pour, then the back is poured against it.":`托盘中的闭合硅胶模：第一次浇注时模型立在垫块上，然后在它的背面浇注另一半。`,"Closed {n} hole(s).":`已封闭 {n} 个孔。`,Closure:`闭合方式`,"Coat the inside of each case with mold release (soap size or a release agent made for plaster).":`在每个外箱内部涂上脱模剂（肥皂水或石膏专用脱模剂）。`,Columns:`列`,Compression:`压缩`,"Compression room":`压缩余量`,Concrete:`混凝土`,"Convert to planter":`转换为花盆`,"Cookie Cutter":`饼干切模`,"Cookie outline":`饼干轮廓`,"Copy of {piece} (print)":`{piece}的复制件（打印用）`,Core:`型芯`,"Core & base plate":`型芯和底板`,"Core & lid":`型芯和盖子`,"Core clearance":`型芯间隙`,"Core draft":`型芯拔模角`,"Corner radius":`圆角半径`,"Cradle depth":`托架深度`,"Cradle wall":`托架壁厚`,Cup:`杯子`,"Cup wall":`杯壁`,Cups:`杯体`,Custom:`自定义`,"Custom (machine bed)":`自定义（机床台面）`,"Custom silicone":`自定义硅胶`,"Custom size":`自定义尺寸`,"Cut holes too":`孔也切出`,"Cut the view in half to see the model inside the mold":`把视图剖开一半，看到模具里的模型`,Cutaway:`剖视`,Cuts:`切割`,"Cuts placed automatically: {n} split plane(s). Move or turn them in manual layout.":`已自动放置切割：{n} 个分模面。可在手动布局中移动或旋转。`,"Cuts the model at a rim height and hollows it, with a drainage hole. Changes the cast.":`在口沿高度截断模型并掏空，带排水孔。会改变铸件。`,Cutter:`切模`,"Cutter height":`切模高度`,"Cutter size":`切模尺寸`,"Dam for piece {n}":`第 {n} 块的占位块`,"Deepens every groove by 1 mm for clay, hot glue or silicone caulk":`每道槽加深 1 mm，用于黏土、热熔胶或硅酮密封胶`,"Deepens the seal groove by 1 mm for a bead of clay, silicone caulk or petroleum jelly":`把密封槽加深 1 mm，用于黏土、硅酮密封胶或凡士林条`,Delete:`删除`,"Delete funnel":`删除漏斗`,"Delete key":`删除定位键`,"Delete pillar":`删除支柱`,"Delete preset “{name}”":`删除预设“{name}”`,"Delete split plane":`删除分模面`,"Delete vent":`删除排气孔`,Density:`密度`,Depth:`深度`,Die:`压模`,"Die and piston for pressing clay or soap: the model’s top face is formed at the bottom of the die.":`用于压制黏土或肥皂的压模和压头：模型顶面在压模底部成型。`,"Die floor":`压模底厚`,"Die outer size":`压模外形尺寸`,"Die wall":`压模壁厚`,"Direct-Print Mold":`直接打印模具`,"Direct-print molds":`直接打印模具`,"Dowel holes":`定位销孔`,"Dowel Ø":`定位销 Ø`,Download:`下载`,"Download STL":`下载 STL`,Draft:`拔模角`,"Draft (fast)":`草稿（快速）`,"Draft angle":`拔模角`,"Drag the arrow to move the split plane.":`拖动箭头移动分模面。`,"Drag the arrows to move the funnel; it snaps onto the model. Delete removes it.":`拖动箭头移动漏斗；它会吸附到模型上。按 Delete 删除。`,"Drag the arrows to move the key; it stays on its split plane. Delete removes it.":`拖动箭头移动定位键；它保持在分模面上。按 Delete 删除。`,"Drag the arrows to move the pillar; it snaps onto the model. Delete removes it.":`拖动箭头移动支柱；它会吸附到模型上。按 Delete 删除。`,"Drag the arrows to move the vent; it snaps onto the model. Delete removes it.":`拖动箭头移动排气孔；它会吸附到模型上。按 Delete 删除。`,"Drag the rings to tilt the split plane.":`拖动圆环倾斜分模面。`,"Drag to orbit · Right-drag to pan · Scroll to zoom":`拖动旋转 · 右键拖动平移 · 滚轮缩放`,"Drain hole Ø":`排空孔 Ø`,"Drain holes":`排空孔`,"Drainage hole Ø":`排水孔 Ø`,"Drop a 3D model to start":`拖入一个 3D 模型开始`,"Dry the plaster pieces completely before the first cast: several days in a warm room, or about a day at 40 °C.":`首次浇注前让石膏件完全干透：在温暖的房间放几天，或在 40 °C 下约一天。`,"Each cut sits at the model’s widest outline. In manual layout you can move and turn them any way, or add more.":`每个切割都位于模型最宽的轮廓处。在手动布局中可以任意移动、旋转，或再添加。`,"Each half stands, and prints, with its cavity up":`每一半都能以型腔朝上的方式立住和打印`,"Each part is turned onto the side it prints best on: mold parts with their cavity facing up, so they need no supports inside.":`每个零件都转到最适合打印的一面：模具零件型腔朝上，内部不需要支撑。`,"Each part lies on the side it prints best on: mold parts with their cavity up, so they need no supports inside.":`每个零件都放在最适合打印的一面：模具零件型腔朝上，内部不需要支撑。`,"Engrave or raise text, a logo or the material amounts on the mold. On the master, a mark is part of every cast.":`在模具上雕刻或凸起文字、标志或材料用量。放在母模上的标记会出现在每个铸件上。`,Engraved:`雕刻`,"Engraved next to each pocket, from the datum corner":`刻在每个穴位旁，从基准角开始编号`,"Epoxy resin":`环氧树脂`,Explode:`爆炸`,"Explode view":`爆炸视图`,Export:`导出`,Extra:`余量`,"Extra depth for loose material, which the piston packs down":`为松散材料预留的额外深度，由压头压实`,"Extra for mixing & spills":`混合和损耗余量`,"Extra solid base below the model":`模型下方额外的实心底座`,"Extraction layer step":`脱模层步`,"Eyes, slots and windows in the wall count as part of the shell up to 15 mm (Normal) or 40 mm (Aggressive)":`壁上的眼孔、缝和窗口在 15 mm（普通）或 40 mm（激进）以内都算作外壳的一部分`,"Faces within this angle of facing straight down count as the underside":`与竖直向下方向夹角在此范围内的面算作底面`,"Feed from":`进料位置`,Feet:`底脚`,File:`文件`,"File units":`文件单位`,Files:`文件`,"Fill from":`进料方式`,"Fill port & mounting":`注料口与安装`,"Fill port plug":`注料口塞子`,"Fill port Ø":`注料口 Ø`,"Fill the mold right up into the spare with slip, {cast}, and keep it topped up as the level drops.":`用泥浆把模具一直灌满到冒口里，{cast}，液面下降时继续补满。`,"Fill up to":`填充到`,"Filling from below pushes the air out ahead of the material":`从下方灌注会把空气赶在材料前面排出`,"Filling from below pushes the air up: add at least one air vent at the top.":`从下方灌注会把空气推向上方：请在顶部至少加一个排气孔。`,"Fills the gap under the model’s lower edge, so silicone can’t creep underneath or trap air there":`填满模型下边缘下方的缝隙，让硅胶不会钻到下面或在那里困住空气`,"Fills the model’s undercuts so a one-piece mold lifts straight off it. Changes the cast.":`填平模型的倒扣，让一件式模具能直接向上脱出。会改变铸件。`,"Fills undercuts on the cast so every plaster piece comes off":`填平铸件上的倒扣，让每块石膏件都能脱出`,"Finger notches":`指槽`,"First pocket from the datum corner":`从基准角算起的第一个穴位`,"First pour: mix {amount} and pour half A over the master until it covers it by the thickness you set. Let it cure.":`第一次浇注：混合 {amount}，把 A 半浇在母模上，直到按设定厚度盖住它。等待固化。`,"First pour: mix {amount} and pour half A over the master. Let it cure.":`第一次浇注：混合 {amount}，把 A 半浇在母模上。等待固化。`,"Fit clearance":`配合间隙`,"Fit the dams together around the master on the base plate, key bumps in their sockets, and tack the master to them with a dab of glue or clay. Each dam holds the place of the silicone piece its file is named after.":`在底板上把占位块围着母模拼好，定位键对准凹槽，再用少许胶水或黏土把母模固定在上面。每个占位块占据与其文件同名的那块硅胶的位置。`,"Fit the pockets":`按穴位大小`,"Fit tolerance":`配合公差`,"Fits inside the cutter and presses the model’s top relief into the dough":`放进切模内，把模型顶面的浮雕压进面团`,"Fitted two-part case that holds an object safe for shipping or storage.":`贴合的两件式保护盒，在运输或存放时保护物件。`,"Fix the master on the base plate: on its locating pins if it has holes for them, otherwise with a little glue or clay.":`把母模固定在底板上：如有孔就装在定位销上，否则用少量胶水或黏土固定。`,"Fix the model to continue.":`请修复模型后继续。`,"Fixed {n} inverted face(s).":`已修正 {n} 个翻转面。`,Fixture:`夹具`,"Fixtures & shells":`夹具与保护壳`,"Flange width":`法兰宽度`,"Flanges go along a single split plane: clamp the parts together instead.":`法兰只能沿单一分模面：请改用夹具把零件夹在一起。`,"Flanges held by":`法兰固定方式`,"Flanges widened to {mm} mm to fit the bolts.":`法兰已加宽到 {mm} mm，以便放下螺栓。`,"Flanges widened to {mm} mm to fit the clips.":`法兰已加宽到 {mm} mm，以便放下卡扣。`,"Flat feet":`平底脚`,"Flat margin round the part on the plinth, which the formed part is trimmed from":`底座上零件周围的平边，成型件从这里修剪下来`,"Flip the cured mold into the support cradle to keep its shape while casting.":`把固化的模具翻进支撑托架，浇注时保持形状。`,"Floor thickness":`底厚`,"Following the model saves silicone":`随形可节省硅胶`,"Follows the model":`随形`,"Follows the model (lighter)":`随形（更轻）`,"Foot fillet":`底脚圆角`,"Foot height":`底脚高度`,"Foot ring":`圈足`,Footprint:`占地面积`,"For a label inside a cavity, so it reads the right way on the cast":`用于型腔内的标签，让它在铸件上正向可读`,"For a model without an opening: how thick the hollow cast is":`对没有开口的模型：空心铸件的厚度`,"For a watertight seal, press a thin bead of clay, petroleum jelly or silicone caulk into the seal grooves before closing the mold.":`为了密封不漏，合模前在密封槽里压入一条细的黏土、凡士林或硅酮密封胶。`,"For cups, pots and vases cast with their inside: a core hanging from the lid forms the inside, the bucket the outside.":`用于连同内腔一起浇注的杯、盆和花瓶：挂在盖子上的型芯形成内侧，桶形成外侧。`,"For flat-backed pieces cast in a closed mold, such as coasters with a clean back: the back half is poured against the model’s underside.":`用于在闭合模具中浇注的平背件，如背面干净的杯垫：后半部分贴着模型底面浇注。`,"For latex or silicone masks and skins: the printed model is the core, and the skin forms between it and the outer mold.":`用于乳胶或硅胶面具和表皮：打印出的模型就是型芯，表皮在它和外模之间成型。`,"For light, hollow casts: pour in a little material, plug the port and turn the mold every way until it sets. Set the cast wall to get the amount.":`用于轻巧的空心铸件：倒入少量材料，塞住注料口，向各个方向转动模具直到凝固。设定铸件壁厚即可得到用量。`,"For painting, pad printing or engraving in batches: set rows and columns, and size the plate to your machine bed.":`用于批量喷涂、移印或雕刻：设定行和列，并按机床台面确定底板尺寸。`,"For pieces that need a closed mold, like figures and game pieces. Split at the widest point and put a vent on every high point.":`用于需要闭合模具的零件，如手办和棋子。在最宽处分模，并在每个高点放一个排气孔。`,"For pressing clay sprigs, soap or tablets: the model’s top face forms the piece’s face. Fill the die with loose material and press the piston down to its stop.":`用于压制黏土贴花、肥皂或药片：模型顶面构成零件正面。把松散材料装满压模，把压头压到止点。`,"For shapes that stand on a flat base and narrow toward the top: the mold is filled through the opening where the model stood.":`用于立在平底上、越往上越窄的形状：从模型原来站立处的开口注料。`,"For shapes two halves can’t let go of, like the bobbin: its washer has to lift up and its spool come off sideways. Automatic finds the fewest cuts; move or add them in manual layout.":`适用于两半模放不开的形状，例如线轴：垫圈要向上取出，轴要向侧面取出。自动模式会找出最少的切割；可在手动布局中移动或添加。`,"For shipping or storing a fragile object: pick a snap lip or magnets, and leave room for a foam lining.":`用于运输或存放易碎物件：选择卡扣唇边或磁铁，并留出泡棉衬垫的空间。`,"For slip-cast ceramics: pour the plaster pieces in the printed cases, dry them well, then fill the mold with slip and pour it out when the wall is thick enough.":`用于注浆陶瓷：在打印的外箱中浇注石膏件，彻底晾干，然后往模具里灌泥浆，壁厚足够时倒出。`,"For the preview of the formed part and how much plastic it takes":`用于预览成型件及其所需塑料量`,"For vacuum-formed trays, masks and packaging: a draft of 2–5° and a vent in every recess let the sheet form tightly and come off cleanly.":`用于真空成型的托盘、面具和包装：2–5° 的拔模角和每个凹处的排气孔能让片材贴合紧密、脱模干净。`,"Formed sheet (preview)":`成型片材（预览）`,"Forming, pressing & cutting":`成型、压制与切割`,"Forms a ridge in the sheet to cut along":`在片材上压出一道棱，沿它裁切`,Foundation:`底座加固`,"Foundation: no faces point down within the set angle, so nothing was added.":`底座加固：在设定角度内没有朝下的面，因此没有添加任何内容。`,"Foundation: the underside is already solid and flat.":`底座加固：底面已是实心平面。`,"Frame bolt":`框架螺栓`,"Frame bolt Ø":`框架螺栓 Ø`,"Frame hole spacing":`框架孔距`,"Front (−Y)":`前 (−Y)`,"Funnel cone height":`漏斗锥高`,"Funnel top Ø":`漏斗顶部直径 Ø`,"Gaps up to this far above the base are filled; higher ones are left as they are":`填补底面以上这个高度内的缝隙；更高的保持原样`,"Gasket (TPU)":`密封垫（TPU）`,"Gasket squeeze":`密封垫压缩量`,"Gasket {n} (TPU)":`密封垫 {n}（TPU）`,"Generate printable mold systems from your 3D models, right in the browser.":`在浏览器中直接用你的 3D 模型生成可打印的模具系统。`,"Generating {name}…":`正在生成 {name}…`,"Generating…":`正在生成…`,"Generation failed: {error}":`生成失败：{error}`,"Glue a {d} × {h} mm magnet into each of the {n} pockets in both halves, turned so they attract.":`在两半的 {n} 个穴位中各粘一块 {d} × {h} mm 的磁铁，方向要互相吸引。`,"Glue the magnets into their pockets in both halves, turned so they attract.":`把磁铁粘进两半的穴位中，方向要互相吸引。`,"Good for figures and rounded shapes: the box steps in with the model, so you mix less silicone. The Material saving preset with the support cradle makes the thinnest molds.":`适合手办和圆润造型：盒子随模型逐级收窄，因此需要调配的硅胶更少。“省料”预设配合支撑托架可得到最薄的模具。`,"Good for flat-backed pieces such as plaques, tiles and badges: the back stays open and is poured level.":`适合平背件，如牌匾、瓷砖和徽章：背面敞开并浇平。`,Grid:`阵列`,"Grid of copies":`复制阵列`,"Grid: {cols} × {rows} copies, {mm} mm apart.":`阵列：{cols} × {rows} 个副本，间距 {mm} mm。`,"Grip height":`把手高度`,"Grip rim height":`握边高度`,"Grip rim width":`握边宽度`,"HIPS / styrene sheet":`HIPS / 苯乙烯片材`,"Heat the sheet until it sags, lower it over the buck and switch the vacuum on.":`加热片材直到下垂，把它放到阳模上并打开真空。`,"Height of the capital letters":`大写字母高度`,"Height of the logo":`标志高度`,"High detail (slow)":`高精度（慢）`,"Hinge & stacking":`铰链与堆叠`,"Hinge clearance":`铰链间隙`,"Hinged shell (prints open)":`带铰链的外壳（展开打印）`,"Hold depth":`夹持深度`,"Hold height":`夹持高度`,"Hold overhangs up and leave vents where air would be trapped once the mold is flipped":`支撑悬垂部分，并在模具翻转后会困住空气的地方留出排气孔`,"Holding plate with pockets for painting, pad printing, engraving or assembly.":`带穴位的夹持板，用于喷涂、移印、雕刻或装配。`,"Holes in the outline get blades of their own":`轮廓中的孔会有自己的刃`,"Hollow cast (preview)":`空心铸件（预览）`,"Hollow cast ({v} cm³ inside): the printed core fills the inside. It stands in the mold through the bottom and pulls straight out after casting.":`空心铸件（内部 {v} cm³）：打印的型芯填满内部。它穿过底部立在模具中，浇注后直接拔出。`,"Hollow inside":`内部空心`,"Hollow model: filled the {v} cm³ inside and closed {n} wall opening(s), left as shallow dents, so the cast comes out solid.":`空心模型：已填满内部 {v} cm³，并封闭 {n} 个壁上开口（留作浅凹），使铸件为实心。`,"Hollow model: filled the {v} cm³ inside so the cast comes out solid.":`空心模型：已填满内部 {v} cm³，使铸件为实心。`,"Hollow models":`空心模型`,"Hollow printed master":`空心打印母模`,"Hollow: {v} cm³ inside, {n} wall opening(s) found.":`空心：内部 {v} cm³，发现 {n} 个壁上开口。`,"Hollow: {v} cm³ inside.":`空心：内部 {v} cm³。`,"Hollowed to a {wall} mm wall, open at {h} mm up.":`已掏空至 {wall} mm 壁厚，从 {h} mm 高处开口。`,"Horizontal (Z)":`水平 (Z)`,"Horizontal + X + Y":`水平 + X + Y`,"Horizontal + vertical (X)":`水平 + 竖直 (X)`,"Horizontal + vertical (Y)":`水平 + 竖直 (Y)`,"How deep it is engraved, or how far it stands out":`雕刻深度，或凸出高度`,"How far above the lowest point the underside is filled":`底面从最低点向上填充的高度`,"How far the gasket stands proud of the parting face, to be pressed flat":`密封垫高出分型面多少，以便被压平`,"How thick the half poured against the model’s underside is":`贴着模型底面浇注的那一半的厚度`,"How tightly the clips hold the flanges: more presses the halves together harder, but the clips push on and pull off harder.":`卡扣夹住法兰的松紧：越紧两半压得越牢，但卡扣也越难装上和取下。`,"In the base, to empty resin prints":`在底部，用于排空树脂打印件`,"Inner Cavity":`内腔`,"Inside of the cast":`铸件内部`,"Instead of the tongue, a flexible gasket to print in TPU that fills the groove and is pressed flat by the part across: seals without caulk. Clamp the mold firmly.":`代替凸榫：用 TPU 打印的柔性密封垫，填满凹槽，由对面的零件压平：无需密封胶即可密封。请把模具夹紧。`,"Interlocking ridge along the wall seams to stop leaks":`沿盒壁接缝互相咬合的凸棱，防止渗漏`,"Joined vertices closer than {mm} mm.":`已合并距离小于 {mm} mm 的顶点。`,"Key radius":`定位键半径`,"Kind of mold":`模具类型`,"Label text":`标签文字`,"Labelling the master…":`正在给母模加标记…`,"Labels & branding":`标签与品牌`,Language:`语言`,"Lay the jacket parts into the support shell parts.":`把外套各部分放入支撑壳各部分。`,"Lay the object in the bottom half and close the top; the magnets hold it shut.":`把物件放进下半部并合上盖子；磁铁会让它保持闭合。`,"Lay the object in the bottom half and press the top on over the lip; tape it if it has to stay shut.":`把物件放进下半部，把盖子压到唇边上；需要保持闭合时用胶带封住。`,"Lay the object in the bottom half and press the top on until the snap bumps click.":`把物件放进下半部，按下盖子直到卡扣咔嗒扣上。`,"Lay the object in the bottom half, put the top on (the keys line it up) and hold the halves together with tape or straps.":`把物件放进下半部，盖上盖子（定位键会对齐），用胶带或绑带把两半固定在一起。`,Layout:`布局`,"Layout mode":`布局模式`,"Left (−X)":`左 (−X)`,"Left out: see the notes under Results.":`已省略：请查看“结果”下的说明。`,"Length to the button":`到浇口杯的长度`,"Let MoldForge find a free face for it":`让 MoldForge 为它找一个空闲面`,"Let it cool, lift the formed part off and trim it{trim}. Sheet per pull: {cast}.":`等它冷却，取下成型件并修剪{trim}。每次成型用片材：{cast}。`,"Let it cure fully. Take off the walls and the base plate and pull the master out of the silicone.":`等待完全固化。拆下盒壁和底板，从硅胶中拔出母模。`,"Let it cure, lift the core out, then take the cast out of the bucket.":`等待固化，提出型芯，然后从桶中取出铸件。`,"Let it cure, open the mold and cut off the sprue and the vents.":`等待固化，打开模具，剪掉浇道和排气杆。`,"Let it cure, take off the outer mold and peel the skin off the core.":`等待固化，拆下外模，从型芯上剥下表皮。`,"Let it cure, take the parts off in part-number order, each the way the exploded view moves it, and cut off the sprue and the vents.":`等待固化，按零件编号顺序取下各零件（沿爆炸视图中移动的方向），然后剪掉浇道和排气杆。`,"Let it cure, then take the mold off the cast.":`等待固化，然后把模具从铸件上取下。`,"Let the plaster set (about half an hour), flex the silicone and take the piece out. The case molds make as many sets as you need.":`让石膏凝固（约半小时），弯曲硅胶取出石膏件。外箱模可按需做出任意多套。`,"Lid thickness":`盖子厚度`,"Line the inside with {mm} mm of foam or felt.":`在内部衬上 {mm} mm 厚的泡棉或毛毡。`,"Lip clearance":`唇边间隙`,"Lip with snap bumps":`带卡扣的唇边`,"Liquid latex (skins)":`液体乳胶（表皮）`,"Load a model to generate a mold.":`载入模型以生成模具。`,"Load preset":`载入预设`,Locating:`定位`,"Locating pins":`定位销`,"Logo · {name}":`标志 · {name}`,"Looking for a hollow inside…":`正在查找空心内部…`,"Loose material to fill the die":`装满压模所需的松散材料`,"Magnet height":`磁铁高度`,"Magnet Ø":`磁铁 Ø`,Magnets:`磁铁`,"Make the plaster pieces around it one at a time the traditional way: bed the master in clay up to the parting line, set up cottle boards, cut natches into each piece before pouring the next against it. The previews show where the pieces part and where the natches go: {pieces}.":`按传统方法围绕它逐块制作石膏件：把母模埋入黏土直到分模线，搭好围板，在浇注下一块之前在每块上刻出定位榫。预览显示各块的分界和定位榫的位置：{pieces}。`,"Make the plaster pieces the traditional way (clay bed and cottle boards) around the Prepared master; the previews show where the pieces part and where the natches go.":`按传统方法（黏土床和围板）围绕处理后的母模制作石膏件；预览显示各块的分界和定位榫的位置。`,"Make the plaster pieces with":`石膏件的制作方式`,"Make the silicone jacket over the master (see the silicone amount above): brush it on in layers, or pour it into the closed shell around the master, then cut it open along the split lines.":`在母模上做硅胶外套（硅胶用量见上方）：分层刷涂，或浇进包住母模的闭合外壳中，然后沿分模线切开。`,Manual:`手动`,Marking:`标记`,Mask:`面具`,"Master preparation":`母模处理`,"Material per piece":`每件用料`,"Material saving":`省料`,Materials:`材料`,"Merged {n} overlapping shells into one solid.":`已把 {n} 个重叠壳体合并为一个实体。`,Mirror:`镜像`,"Mix per bath bomb":`每个浴球的用料`,"Mix ratio, part A":`混合比例，A 组分`,"Mix ratio, part B":`混合比例，B 组分`,"Mix the plaster for each piece: sift it into the water, let it soak for 2 minutes, stir for 2 to 3 minutes, and pour it in slowly until it is level with the top of the case: {pieces}.":`为每块调配石膏：把石膏粉撒入水中，浸泡 2 分钟，搅拌 2 到 3 分钟，然后慢慢倒入直到与外箱顶部齐平：{pieces}。`,"Mix {amount} and pour it slowly into a corner of the box, until it covers the model by the silicone thickness you set.":`混合 {amount}，慢慢倒入盒子的一角，直到按设定的硅胶厚度盖住模型。`,Model:`模型`,"Model repaired automatically":`模型已自动修复`,"Model too short for bolt holes; clamp the flanges with spring clamps.":`模型太矮，无法开螺栓孔；请用弹簧夹夹紧法兰。`,"Model too short for clips; clamp the flanges with spring clamps.":`模型太矮，放不下卡扣；请用弹簧夹夹紧法兰。`,"Model volume":`模型体积`,"Model, orientation and all settings in one file":`模型、方向和所有设置保存在一个文件中`,Mold:`模具`,"Mold body":`模体`,"Mold bottom":`模具下部`,"Mold half A":`模具半边 A`,"Mold half B":`模具半边 B`,"Mold lifts off":`模具脱出方向`,"Mold outer size":`模具外形尺寸`,"Mold part {n}":`模具零件 {n}`,"Mold parts":`模具零件`,"Mold system":`模具系统`,"Mold top":`模具上部`,"Mold wall":`模具壁厚`,"Mold wall too thin for a seal ring: seal the parting line with clay or caulk and clamp it tightly.":`模具壁太薄，放不下密封环：请用黏土或密封胶封住分模线，并把模具夹紧。`,"More cuts free more complex shapes, but make more pieces":`切割越多，能取出的形状越复杂，但块数也越多`,"More pieces come off more easily around complex shapes":`分块越多，复杂形状越容易脱模`,"More steps follow the model more closely and use less silicone":`级数越多越贴合模型，硅胶用量越少`,"Most cuts":`最多切割数`,"Mount plate":`安装板`,"Mounting tabs":`安装耳`,Move:`移动`,"Multi-Part Silicone":`多块硅胶模`,Mushroom:`蘑菇`,"Name for current settings":`当前设置的名称`,"Natch radius":`定位榫半径`,"Next: {step}":`下一步：{step}`,"No hollow interior found. Openings bigger than the detection size stay open.":`未发现空心内部。大于检测尺寸的开口保持敞开。`,"No model yet: choose a file or try a sample.":`还没有模型：请选择文件或试用示例。`,"No opening at the top was found, so the model is hollowed to the wall thickness instead.":`顶部未找到开口，因此改为按壁厚掏空模型。`,"No opening at the top was found, so the slip goes in through a pour hole.":`顶部未找到开口，因此泥浆从浇注孔注入。`,"No presets yet":`还没有预设`,"No room for a skirt round the base piece: line it up under the side pieces by hand.":`底块四周放不下裙边：请在侧块下方手动对齐底块。`,"No room for bolt holes across split plane {n}: clamp the parts together there, or thicken the mold wall.":`分模面 {n} 上放不下螺栓孔：请在那里用夹具把零件夹在一起，或加厚模具壁。`,"No room for magnets in the wall: they need about {mm} mm of it.":`壁中放不下磁铁：它们需要约 {mm} mm 的壁厚。`,"No room for natches between the base piece and the sides.":`底块与侧块之间放不下定位榫。`,"No room for registration keys beside the seal ring: its tongue and groove line the parts up instead.":`密封环旁边放不下定位键：由它的凸榫和凹槽来对齐零件。`,"No room for registration keys beside the seal ring: line the parts up by hand before you clamp them.":`密封环旁边放不下定位键：夹紧前请用手对齐零件。`,"No room for registration keys between the split planes.":`分模面之间放不下定位键。`,"No room on the top face to number pocket(s) {list}: widen the space between the pockets or the wall.":`顶面没有空间给穴位 {list} 编号：请加大穴位间距或壁厚。`,"No set of up to {n} cuts lets every piece peel straight off: the silicone has to stretch over about {v} cm³ of undercut. Allow more cuts, or add them by hand.":`最多 {n} 个切割的任何组合都无法让每块直接剥离：硅胶需要拉伸越过约 {v} cm³ 的倒扣。请允许更多切割，或手动添加。`,"No set of up to {n} cuts lets every rigid part slide straight off: turn on Clear extraction, allow more cuts, or use a flexible silicone mold.":`最多 {n} 个切割的任何组合都无法让每个刚性部件直接滑出：请打开自由脱模，允许更多切割，或改用柔性硅胶模。`,"No trapped-air points besides the top, which the pour funnel vents — no vent pins needed.":`除顶部外没有气穴，而顶部已由浇注漏斗排气 —— 无需排气杆。`,"No triangle meshes found in the file.":`文件中未找到三角网格。`,None:`无`,Normal:`普通`,"Notch Ø":`指槽 Ø`,Notes:`说明`,"Nothing (plaster pieces only)":`无（只有石膏件）`,"Number height":`数字高度`,"Number the pockets":`给穴位编号`,Numbers:`编号`,Off:`关`,"On the master, which this mold system leaves as it is: left out.":`在母模上，而此模具系统不改动母模：已省略。`,"On the model’s top, closed with a printed plug":`在模型顶部，用打印的塞子封住`,"On {part}":`在 {part} 上`,"On {part} (automatic){size}":`在 {part} 上（自动）{size}`,"Once the cast comes away from the plaster, trim the spare off{trim} and open the mold. Dry the pieces again after a few casts.":`铸件从石膏上脱离后，切掉冒口{trim}并打开模具。浇注几次后要再次晾干石膏件。`,"One vertical (X)":`一个竖直 (X)`,"One vertical (Y)":`一个竖直 (Y)`,"One-piece open silicone mold in a rectangular box, for flat-backed parts.":`矩形盒中的一件式开放硅胶模，适用于平背零件。`,"One-piece silicone mold in a box that follows the model, so it takes less silicone.":`随模型外形的盒中的一件式硅胶模，因此更省硅胶。`,"Only the first {n} split planes are used.":`只使用前 {n} 个分模面。`,"Only {n} trapped-air point(s) needed a vent.":`只有 {n} 个气穴需要排气孔。`,"Open side":`开口侧`,"Open the box, part the halves and take out the master and the pins.":`打开盒子，分开两半，取出母模和各杆。`,"Open the box, part the two silicone halves and take out the master and the pins.":`打开盒子，分开两半硅胶，取出母模和各杆。`,"Open the box, peel the silicone pieces apart and take out the master and the pins.":`打开盒子，分开各块硅胶，取出母模和各杆。`,"Open the mold and take out the hollow cast.":`打开模具，取出空心铸件。`,"Open-Base Mold":`开底模具`,Opening:`开口`,"Opening detection":`开口检测`,"Opening project…":`正在打开项目…`,"Orient parts for printing":`为打印调整零件方向`,"Orientation & scale":`方向与缩放`,"Other (set the hole Ø)":`其他（自行设置孔 Ø）`,"Outer mold":`外模`,"Outer mold parts":`外模零件`,"Outer mold {letter}":`外模 {letter}`,"Outer size":`外形尺寸`,Outline:`轮廓`,Output:`输出`,Outside:`外形`,"Overfill both halves, press them together with a slight twist and let the overflow ring take the excess.":`把两半都装得满出来，稍微一拧把它们压合，让溢料环收走多余的料。`,"Overfill each half with mix ({cast} per bath bomb), heaped above the rim.":`每一半都装满混合料并高出边缘（每个浴球 {cast}）。`,Overflow:`溢料`,"Overflow ring":`溢料环`,"Overlapping lip":`搭接唇边`,"PETG sheet":`PETG 片材`,"Padding liner":`衬垫`,"Parameter detail":`参数详略`,"Part A · Part B ({a}:{b})":`A 组分 · B 组分 ({a}:{b})`,Parting:`分模`,"Parting height":`分模高度`,"Parting insert":`分模垫件`,"Parting plane":`分模面`,"Parting plane tilt":`分模面倾角`,"Parting spacer":`分模垫块`,Parts:`零件`,Pawn:`兵`,"Pillar Ø":`支柱 Ø`,"Pillars go under an overhang of the model.":`支柱应放在模型的悬垂部分下方。`,"Pin Ø":`销 Ø`,"Pins on the base plate that fit holes in the printed master, so it can’t slide. The cast has no holes.":`底板上的销，插入打印母模的孔中，防止滑动。铸件上不会有孔。`,Piston:`压头`,"Piston clearance":`压头间隙`,"Place in the view…":`在视图中放置…`,"Placed at the highest local peaks of the model":`放在模型最高的局部峰点上`,"Placed automatically on a free face.":`已自动放在空闲面上。`,"Placed by hand.":`已手动放置。`,"Plane tilt":`平面倾角`,"Plane tool":`平面工具`,Planter:`花盆`,"Planter: hollowed to a {wall} mm wall, open {h} mm up, with a drainage hole.":`花盆：已掏空至 {wall} mm 壁厚，开口高度 {h} mm，带排水孔。`,"Planter: hollowed to a {wall} mm wall, open {h} mm up.":`花盆：已掏空至 {wall} mm 壁厚，开口高度 {h} mm。`,"Planter: there is no room for that wall at that rim height.":`花盆：在该口沿高度放不下这个壁厚。`,Plaque:`牌匾`,Plaster:`石膏`,"Plaster (wet mix)":`石膏（湿料）`,"Plaster base":`石膏底块`,"Plaster in all: {p} of plaster in {w} of water ({c} parts water per 100 plaster)":`石膏合计：{p} 石膏兑 {w} 水（每 100 份石膏 {c} 份水）`,"Plaster mold":`石膏模`,"Plaster mold for slip casting ceramics, with a spare and natches, and printed cases to pour the plaster pieces in.":`用于陶瓷注浆的石膏模，带冒口和定位榫，并有打印的外箱用来浇注石膏件。`,"Plaster mold size":`石膏模尺寸`,"Plaster pieces":`石膏件`,"Plaster side {letter}":`石膏侧块 {letter}`,"Plaster to mix":`需调配的石膏`,"Plaster wall":`石膏壁厚`,"Plaster {g} g + water {w} g":`石膏 {g} g + 水 {w} g`,Plate:`板`,"Plate depth (Y)":`板深 (Y)`,"Plate size":`板尺寸`,"Plate width (X)":`板宽 (X)`,"Platinum-cure silicone, 10:1":`铂金固化硅胶，10:1`,"Platinum-cure silicone, 1:1":`铂金固化硅胶，1:1`,"Plinth & trim":`底座与修边`,"Plinth height":`底座高度`,"Pocket pitch":`穴位间距`,Pockets:`穴位`,"Pockets for several objects at once":`一次放置多个物件的穴位`,"Polyurethane resin":`聚氨酯树脂`,"Pottery plaster is usually mixed at 65–75 (by weight): more water makes a softer mold that takes up water faster":`陶瓷石膏通常按 65–75 调配（按重量）：水越多，模具越软，吸水越快`,"Pour & vents":`浇注与排气`,"Pour & vents (in the back)":`浇注与排气（在背面）`,"Pour 1: mix {amount} and pour silicone piece 1 into the space the dams leave open. Let it cure.":`第 1 次浇注：混合 {amount}，把第 1 块硅胶浇入占位块留出的空间。等待固化。`,"Pour funnel":`浇注漏斗`,"Pour hole Ø":`浇注孔 Ø`,"Pour latex or silicone into the funnel, let it cure (or slush latex and pour the rest out), then take off the outer mold and peel the skin off the core.":`把乳胶或硅胶倒进漏斗，等待固化（或把乳胶晃匀后倒出剩余部分），然后拆下外模，从型芯上剥下表皮。`,"Pour opening":`浇注口`,"Pour the silicone for each case mold over its copy (see the silicone amounts above), let it cure, take off the walls and base plate and pull the copy out.":`把每个外箱模的硅胶浇在它的复制件上（硅胶用量见上方），等待固化，拆下盒壁和底板，取出复制件。`,"Pour {cast} into the opening per cast. Let it cure, then flex the silicone to take the cast out.":`每次浇注往开口里倒入 {cast}。等待固化，然后弯曲硅胶取出铸件。`,"Pour {cast} of casting material in through the fill port and push the plug in.":`从注料口倒入 {cast} 浇注材料并塞上塞子。`,"Pour {cast} of latex or silicone into the funnel until it rises in the vents. For a latex skin you can also fill it, wait until the skin is thick enough, and pour the rest back out.":`往漏斗里倒入 {cast} 乳胶或硅胶，直到它从排气孔升上来。做乳胶表皮时也可以先灌满，等表皮够厚后再把剩余的倒出。`,"Pour {cast} slowly into the funnel beside the model: it fills the cavity from the bottom up. Stop when it rises in the air vents.":`把 {cast} 慢慢倒进模型旁边的漏斗：它会从下往上充满型腔。从排气孔升上来时停止。`,"Pour {cast} slowly into the funnel until it rises in the air vents.":`把 {cast} 慢慢倒进漏斗，直到从排气孔升上来。`,"Pour {cast} straight into the opening; the vent channels let trapped air out.":`把 {cast} 直接倒进开口；排气通道会放出被困的空气。`,"Pour {cast} through the funnel in the lid until it rises in the vents.":`通过盖子上的漏斗倒入 {cast}，直到从排气孔升上来。`,"Pour {n}: take out the dam for piece {n}, brush mold release onto the silicone faces around its space, then mix {amount} and pour piece {n}. Let it cure.":`第 {n} 次浇注：取出第 {n} 块的占位块，在其空间周围的硅胶面上刷脱模剂，然后混合 {amount} 并浇注第 {n} 块。等待固化。`,"Pours with the box turned over":`盒子翻转后进行的浇注`,"Prepared master":`处理后的母模`,"Preparing the download…":`正在准备下载…`,"Preparing the master…":`正在处理母模…`,"Preset name":`预设名称`,Presets:`预设`,"Press Mold":`压制模`,"Press the halves together (the keys line them up); the excess squeezes out into the overflow ring. Wipe it off.":`把两半压在一起（定位键会对齐）；多余的料会挤进溢料环。把它擦掉。`,"Press the stamp into the cookie inside the cutter to print its relief, then lift both off.":`在切模内把印章压进饼干，印出浮雕，然后一起取下。`,"Pressed piece":`压制件`,"Print both halves. Stand them on their flat feet, cavity up.":`打印两半。让它们立在平底脚上，型腔朝上。`,"Print each case’s floor and walls. Stand the walls in the floor’s channel and push the clips onto the flanges, spread along each seam, until they click into the grooves; seal the seams with clay if they leak.":`打印每个外箱的底和壁。把壁插进底部的槽里，把卡扣沿每条接缝分散推到法兰上，直到它们咔哒一声卡进卡槽；如有渗漏用黏土封住接缝。`,"Print each case’s floor and walls. Stand the walls in the floor’s channel and screw the flanges together; seal the seams with clay if they leak.":`打印每个外箱的底和壁。把壁插进底部的槽里并用螺丝锁紧法兰；如有渗漏用黏土封住接缝。`,"Print the Model and use it as your master (sand and seal it for a smooth cast).":`打印模型并用作母模（打磨并封闭表面，铸件更光滑）。`,"Print the Prepared master (it carries the spare{feet}).":`打印处理后的母模（上面带有冒口{feet}）。`,"Print the Prepared master and use it as your master (sand and seal it for a smooth cast).":`打印处理后的母模并用作母模（打磨并封闭表面，铸件更光滑）。`,"Print the Prepared master: it has {n} hole(s) for the base plate’s locating pins.":`打印处理后的母模：上面有 {n} 个孔，对应底板的定位销。`,"Print the buck and sand it smooth: the sheet shows every line.":`打印阳模并打磨光滑：片材会显出每一道纹路。`,"Print the bucket and the core & lid, and coat them with mold release.":`打印桶以及型芯和盖子，并涂上脱模剂。`,"Print the case floors with low infill: they only have to hold their shape.":`用低填充率打印外箱的底：它们只需保持形状。`,"Print the copies of the plaster pieces and their case boxes. Fix each copy on its case’s base plate, back face down, stand the walls around it and join them.":`打印石膏件的复制件及其外箱。把每个复制件背面朝下固定在其外箱的底板上，把壁围在四周并拼好。`,"Print the core & base plate and the outer mold parts. Coat them with mold release (latex usually needs none).":`打印型芯和底板以及外模各部分。涂上脱模剂（乳胶通常不需要）。`,"Print the cutter grip down, blade up (and the stamp, if you made one).":`打印切模时把手朝下、刃口朝上（如有印章也一起打印）。`,"Print the dams with low infill: they only have to hold their shape.":`用低填充率打印占位块：它们只需保持形状。`,"Print the die and the piston. Dust the die with cornstarch (clay) or oil it lightly (soap).":`打印压模和压头。压模撒上玉米淀粉（黏土）或薄薄抹油（肥皂）。`,"Print the fixture.":`打印夹具。`,"Print the gaskets in TPU (Shore 85A–95A). Press each into its groove as you put the parts together, its flat face standing proud; where a gasket runs across two parts, put those two together first. Rubber bands won’t press the gaskets flat: use bolts or clamps.":`用 TPU（邵氏 85A–95A）打印密封垫。组装零件时把每条密封垫压入它的凹槽，平面朝外凸出；密封垫跨过两个零件的地方，先把这两个零件合在一起。橡皮筋压不平密封垫：请用螺栓或夹子。`,"Print the hinged shell lying open, as it comes, and work the hinge gently until it turns freely.":`按原样展开打印带铰链的外壳，然后轻轻活动铰链直到转动顺畅。`,"Print the mold and coat the cavity with mold release.":`打印模具并在型腔上涂脱模剂。`,"Print the mold parts and the fill port plug, and coat the cavity with mold release.":`打印模具零件和注料口塞子，并在型腔上涂脱模剂。`,"Print the mold parts. Coat the cavity with mold release (seal it first if your material sticks to plastic).":`打印模具零件。在型腔上涂脱模剂（如果材料会粘塑料，先做封闭处理）。`,"Print the shell top and bottom.":`打印外壳的上部和下部。`,"Print the support shell parts and the fill port plug.":`打印支撑壳各部分和注料口塞子。`,"Print the {n} clips as laid out, standing on their ends, in PETG or PLA (PETG keeps its grip longer). They fit anywhere along the grooves: print more if a seam needs more.":`按排好的样子打印这 {n} 个卡扣，竖立在一端上，用 PETG 或 PLA（PETG 能更长久地保持夹紧力）。卡扣可以卡在卡槽的任何位置：哪条接缝需要更多，就多打印几个。`,"Print the {n} clips as laid out, standing on their ends, in PETG: plaster warms up as it sets, and PLA clips lose their grip. They fit anywhere along the grooves: print more if a seam needs more.":`按排好的样子打印这 {n} 个卡扣，竖立在一端上，用 PETG：石膏凝固时会发热，PLA 卡扣会失去夹紧力。卡扣可以卡在卡槽的任何位置：哪条接缝需要更多，就多打印几个。`,"Print this as your master":`把它打印出来作为母模`,"Print-in-place hinge":`一体打印铰链`,"Printed case boxes":`打印的浇注外箱`,"Printed casting box + parting insert for a two-part silicone mold.":`打印的浇注盒 + 分模垫件，用于两件式硅胶模。`,"Printed clips":`打印卡扣`,"Printed clips snap into grooves along the flanges, so there is nothing to buy.":`打印的卡扣卡进法兰上的长卡槽里，无需购买任何东西。`,"Printed core and outer mold for casting flexible skins and masks in latex or silicone.":`打印的型芯和外模，用于浇注乳胶或硅胶的柔性表皮和面具。`,"Printed gasket (TPU)":`打印密封垫（TPU）`,"Printed master":`打印母模`,"Printed plastic":`打印耗材`,"Protective Shell":`保护盒`,"Pull the parts apart to see how they fit together":`把零件拉开，看它们如何组装`,"Push it into the machine’s stops with its square datum corner (the one with the triangle); positions in the numbers below are measured from that corner.":`用它的直角基准角（带三角形的那个）顶住机床挡块；下方数字中的位置都从这个角量起。`,"Push the core into the mold from below.":`从下方把型芯推进模具。`,"Push the piston in until its plate meets the die, and press firmly.":`推入压头直到压板贴住压模，然后用力压紧。`,"Put the bucket parts together on their registration keys and clamp them.":`把桶件在定位键上拼合并夹紧。`,"Put the outer mold parts onto the base plate over the core; the keys line them up. Clamp them together.":`把外模各部分套在型芯上放到底板上；定位键会对齐。把它们夹在一起。`,"Put the parting insert on the base plate and set the master into its opening{core}.":`把分模垫件放在底板上，把母模放进它的开口中{core}。`,"Put the parts together on their registration keys and bolt or clamp them tightly.":`把零件在定位键上拼合，用螺栓锁紧或夹紧。`,"Put the parts together on their registration keys and bolt the flanges shut.":`把零件在定位键上拼合，并用螺栓锁紧法兰。`,"Put the parts together on their registration keys and clamp them.":`把零件在定位键上拼合并夹紧。`,"Put the pieces back together in the box (the keys line them up) and pour {cast} through the funnel per cast.":`把各块重新装回盒子（定位键会对齐），每次浇注从漏斗倒入 {cast}。`,"Put the pieces together on their natches and strap them tightly, opening up.":`把各块在定位榫上拼合并捆紧，开口朝上。`,Quality:`质量`,Raised:`凸起`,"Reading model…":`正在读取模型…`,Rectangular:`矩形`,Redo:`重做`,"Redo (Ctrl+Shift+Z)":`重做 (Ctrl+Shift+Z)`,"Registration keys":`定位键`,"Registration keys made smaller (radius {mm} mm) to fit outside the seal ring.":`定位键已缩小（半径 {mm} mm），以便放在密封环外侧。`,Release:`顶出`,"Release hole Ø":`顶出孔 Ø`,"Release holes":`顶出孔`,"Relief depth":`浮雕深度`,"Relief stamp":`浮雕印章`,Remove:`移除`,"Remove undercuts":`去除倒扣`,"Removed {n} duplicate face(s).":`已删除 {n} 个重复面。`,"Repaired mesh topology.":`已修复网格拓扑。`,Reset:`重置`,"Reset layout":`重置布局`,"Reset to defaults":`恢复默认值`,"Resolved {n} non-manifold edge(s).":`已处理 {n} 条非流形边。`,"Right (+X)":`右 (+X)`,"Rigid printed mold":`刚性打印模具`,"Rigid printed mold halves with a funnel — pour resin, plaster or wax directly.":`带漏斗的刚性打印模具两半 —— 直接浇注树脂、石膏或蜡。`,"Rigid printed mold open where the model stands: turn it over and pour straight in.":`在模型站立处开口的刚性打印模具：翻过来直接倒入。`,"Rim height":`口沿高度`,"Rim width":`边宽`,Ring:`圆环`,"Ring depth":`环深`,"Ring width":`环宽`,"Ring width / pad Ø":`环宽 / 垫脚 Ø`,"Roll the dough out, press the cutter straight down and lift it off.":`擀开面团，把切模垂直压下再提起。`,"Room for a foam or felt lining, on top of the fit clearance":`在配合间隙之外为泡棉或毛毡衬垫留出的空间`,"Room for a sealant bead":`为密封胶条留出的空间`,"Rotate by":`旋转角度`,"Rotate {deg}° around {axis}":`绕 {axis} 旋转 {deg}°`,Rotation:`旋转`,"Rotocast Mold":`旋转浇铸模`,Rows:`行`,"STL · OBJ · 3MF · PLY · MoldForge project":`STL · OBJ · 3MF · PLY · MoldForge 项目`,"STL, OBJ, 3MF or PLY — nothing is uploaded, all geometry runs locally.":`STL、OBJ、3MF 或 PLY —— 不会上传任何内容，所有几何计算都在本地完成。`,"STL, one file per part":`STL，每个零件一个文件`,Save:`保存`,"Save project":`保存项目`,"Saves filament when you print the master; the mold only uses its outside":`打印母模时节省耗材；模具只用到它的外表面`,Scale:`缩放`,"Screw hole Ø":`螺丝孔 Ø`,"Screw it down through the holes in its flange.":`通过法兰上的孔用螺丝固定。`,"Screw size":`螺丝规格`,"Screws or bolts":`螺丝或螺栓`,Seal:`密封`,"Seal groove (width × depth)":`密封槽（宽 × 深）`,"Seal height":`密封高度`,"Seal ring":`密封环`,"Seal to base":`与底面密封`,"Seal to base: the model already sits flat on the base.":`与底面密封：模型已经平放在底面上。`,"Seam rotation":`接缝旋转`,"Second pour: mix {amount} and pour half B. Let it cure.":`第二次浇注：混合 {amount}，浇注 B 半。等待固化。`,"Seen from above, the model is too small or thin for a cookie cutter.":`从上方看，模型太小或太细，做不了饼干切模。`,"Set it on the machine’s dowel pins: the round hole first, then the slot.":`把它放到机床的定位销上：先套圆孔，再套长圆孔。`,"Set the core & lid on the bucket; the bumps in its corners find their place.":`把型芯和盖子放到桶上；角上的凸点会自动就位。`,"Set the mold, opening up, into the support cradle.":`把模具开口朝上放进支撑托架。`,"Set the objects into the pockets{notches}.":`把物件放进穴位{notches}。`,"Sets how much slush goes in per cast (surface area × wall)":`决定每次浇注的用量（表面积 × 壁厚）`,"Several copies of the model in one mold, for batches":`一个模具中放模型的多个副本，用于批量生产`,"Share of the object’s width":`占物件宽度的比例`,Sheet:`片材`,"Sheet area needed":`所需片材面积`,"Sheet per pull":`每次成型用片材`,"Sheet thickness":`片材厚度`,Shell:`外壳`,"Shell bottom":`外壳下部`,"Shell thickness":`外壳厚度`,"Shell top":`外壳上部`,"Show the model":`显示模型`,"Show where the mold splits":`显示模具的分模位置`,"Show, and include in the ZIP":`显示，并包含在 ZIP 中`,"Side split plane {n} runs alongside another, so the plaster pieces don’t use it.":`侧向分模面 {n} 与另一个平行，所以石膏块不使用它。`,"Sides {letters} are the same size, so one set of case walls fits all their floors: pour them one after another, or print the walls again to pour them at once.":`侧块 {letters} 尺寸相同，一套外箱壁适用于它们所有的底：逐个依次浇注，或再打印几套外箱壁以便同时浇注。`,Silicone:`硅胶`,"Silicone (skins, soft casts)":`硅胶（表皮、软质铸件）`,"Silicone above model":`模型上方硅胶厚度`,"Silicone and casting material amounts from the Materials card":`来自“材料”卡片的硅胶和浇注材料用量`,"Silicone around model":`模型四周硅胶厚度`,"Silicone back B":`硅胶背面 B`,"Silicone back B (2nd pour)":`硅胶背面 B（第二次浇注）`,"Silicone block":`硅胶块`,"Silicone case molds":`硅胶外箱模`,"Silicone case molds take longer to make but pour plaster pieces again and again":`硅胶外箱模制作更费时，但可以反复浇注石膏件`,"Silicone half A":`硅胶半模 A`,"Silicone half A (1st pour)":`硅胶半模 A（第一次浇注）`,"Silicone half B":`硅胶半模 B`,"Silicone half B (2nd pour)":`硅胶半模 B（第二次浇注）`,"Silicone in all: {total} of {name} (part A {a} + part B {b})":`硅胶合计：{total} 的 {name}（A 组分 {a} + B 组分 {b}）`,"Silicone jacket":`硅胶外套`,"Silicone jacket in a printed support shell":`打印支撑壳中的硅胶外套`,"Silicone jacket part {n}":`硅胶外套部分 {n}`,"Silicone layer too thin for registration keys.":`硅胶层太薄，放不下定位键。`,"Silicone mold":`硅胶模`,"Silicone molds":`硅胶模具`,"Silicone piece {n}":`硅胶块 {n}`,"Silicone piece {n} doesn’t reach the top or bottom of the box, so it can’t be poured: move or turn the cuts.":`硅胶块 {n} 既碰不到盒子顶部也碰不到底部，无法浇注：请移动或旋转切割。`,"About {v} cm³ between the model and the pour pins is closed off, so no silicone reaches it; the cast fills it there. Move the pour point or the cuts.":`模型与浇注销之间约 {v} cm³ 的空间被封闭，硅胶无法流入；该处将由铸件填充。请移动浇注点或切面。`,"Silicone pieces":`硅胶块数`,"Silicone pieces {list} reach neither the top nor the bottom of the box, so they can’t be poured: cuts that don’t meet inside the box (parallel ones, say) close them in. Remove one of them, or turn it.":`硅胶块 {list} 既碰不到盒子顶部也碰不到底部，无法浇注：在盒内不相交的切割（例如平行的）把它们封住了。请删除其中一个，或将其旋转。`,"Silicone thickness":`硅胶厚度`,"Silicone to mix":`需调配的硅胶`,"Silicone total":`硅胶总量`,"Silicone {g} g ({ratio})":`硅胶 {g} g ({ratio})`,Simple:`简单`,"Simplified from {from} to {to} triangles (max deviation {mm} mm).":`已从 {from} 个三角形简化到 {to} 个（最大偏差 {mm} mm）。`,Size:`尺寸`,"Size to the cast":`按铸件确定尺寸`,"Size to the model":`按模型确定尺寸`,"Size, style & depth":`尺寸、样式与深度`,"Sized to the model":`已按模型确定`,Skin:`表皮`,"Skin & Mask Mold":`表皮与面具模`,"Skin thickness":`表皮厚度`,"Slip to fill the mold":`灌满模具所需的泥浆`,"Slip-Cast Plaster Mold":`注浆石膏模`,"Slot width":`槽宽`,"Slush per cast":`每次浇注用料`,"Smaller = tighter fit, slower":`越小 = 配合越紧，速度越慢`,"Smallest detail":`最小细节`,"Soap base":`皂基`,"Sockets in the top and bottom and loose pins, so shells stack without sliding":`顶部和底部有插孔，配松散销钉，让保护盒堆叠时不滑动`,"Some flanges have no room for a clip; clamp those seams with spring clamps.":`有些法兰没有地方放卡扣；请用弹簧夹夹紧这些接缝。`,"Space between pockets":`穴位间距`,Spacing:`间距`,Spare:`冒口`,"Spare flare":`冒口扩口`,"Spare height":`冒口高度`,Sphere:`球体`,"Spikes and slits finer than this are smoothed away; dough can’t hold them":`比这更细的尖角和细缝会被平滑掉；面团保持不住它们`,"Split at the widest cross-section of the model":`在模型最宽的截面处分模`,"Split direction":`分模方向`,"Split plane {n} doesn’t cross the model.":`分模面 {n} 没有穿过模型。`,"Split plane {n} isn’t needed: the mold comes off without it, so no part is cut there.":`不需要分模面 {n}：没有它模具也能取下，所以这里不切分零件。`,"Split planes, funnels, vents and keys are placed automatically. Switch to Manual to move them yourself.":`分模面、漏斗、排气孔和定位键会自动放置。切换到“手动”即可自己移动它们。`,"Sprue / funnel pin":`浇道 / 漏斗杆`,"Sprue and funnel sized to how much material flows through them":`浇道和漏斗按流经的材料量确定尺寸`,"Sprue rods from the model to a pour button, e.g. for lost-wax casting. Changes the cast.":`从模型连到浇口杯的浇道杆，例如用于失蜡铸造。会改变铸件。`,"Sprue Ø":`浇道 Ø`,Sprues:`浇道`,"Sprues: {n} joined to a pour button {mm} mm above the model.":`浇道：{n} 根连到模型上方 {mm} mm 处的浇口杯。`,"Sprues: {n} joined to a pour button {mm} mm below the model.":`浇道：{n} 根连到模型下方 {mm} mm 处的浇口杯。`,"Square datum corner":`直角基准角`,"Stacking pins":`堆叠销`,"Stacking sockets":`堆叠插孔`,Stamp:`印章`,"Stamp clearance":`印章间隙`,"Stand the base piece on a flat board and set the side pieces round it: their skirts close round it.":`把底块放在平板上，把侧块围在它四周：侧块的裙边会把它围住。`,"Stand the box walls in the base plate’s channel and join them (screws through the flanges, or pins and clamps). Seal the seams if you left room for sealant.":`把盒壁立在底板的槽里并连接起来（螺丝穿过法兰，或用销和夹具）。如果留了密封胶空间，把接缝封好。`,"Stand the box walls in the base plate’s channel and push the clips onto the flanges, spread along each seam, until they click into the grooves. Seal the seams if you left room for sealant.":`把盒壁立在底板的槽里，把卡扣沿每条接缝分散推到法兰上，直到它们咔哒一声卡进卡槽。如果留了密封胶空间，把接缝封好。`,"Stand the box walls in the base plate’s channel around it and join them (screws through the flanges, or pins and clamps).":`把盒壁围着立在底板的槽里并连接起来（螺丝穿过法兰，或用销和夹具）。`,"Stand the box walls in the base plate’s channel around it and push the clips onto the flanges, spread along each seam, until they click into the grooves.":`把盒壁围着立在底板的槽里，把卡扣沿每条接缝分散推到法兰上，直到它们咔哒一声卡进卡槽。`,"Stand the box walls in the base plate’s channel, join them, and set the parting spacer on the base plate inside them.":`把盒壁立在底板的槽里，连接起来，并把分模垫块放在盒内的底板上。`,"Stand the master on the spacer, between its key bumps, and fix it with a little glue or clay.":`把母模立在垫块上定位凸点之间，用少量胶水或黏土固定。`,"Stand the mold on its top on a level surface, opening up.":`把模具倒过来放在平整的台面上，开口朝上。`,"Stand the sprue / funnel pin and the vent pins on the master.":`把浇道 / 漏斗杆和排气杆立在母模上。`,"Stand the sprue / funnel pin and the vent pins on the master’s underside.":`把浇道 / 漏斗杆和排气杆立在母模底面上。`,"Stand the sprue / funnel pin on the master.":`把浇道 / 漏斗杆立在母模上。`,"Stand the vent pins on the master.":`把排气杆立在母模上。`,Standard:`标准`,"Star cookie":`星星饼干`,"Start again from the automatic layout":`从自动布局重新开始`,Steps:`步骤`,"Straight up":`垂直向上`,"Strong support":`强支撑`,Style:`样式`,"Support cradle":`支撑托架`,"Support shell part {n}":`支撑壳部分 {n}`,"Surface area":`表面积`,"Take the mold apart in part-number order, each part the way the exploded view moves it: some come off only once the parts before them are off.":`按零件编号顺序拆开模具，每个零件沿爆炸视图中移动的方向取下：有些零件要等前面的零件取下后才能取下。`,"Take the piston out, turn the die over and push the piece out through the release holes with a pin.":`取出压头，翻转压模，用销子从顶出孔把零件推出来。`,"Tap the case to bring bubbles up, let the plaster set (about half an hour), pull the clips off the walls and lift the piece off the floor.":`轻敲外箱让气泡浮上来，等石膏凝固（约半小时），从壁上取下卡扣，再从底上取下石膏件。`,"Tap the case to bring bubbles up, let the plaster set (about half an hour), unscrew the walls and lift the piece off the floor.":`轻敲外箱让气泡浮上来，等石膏凝固（约半小时），拧下盒壁，从底上取下石膏件。`,"Tap the top half and lift it off, then turn the bath bomb out onto your hand and let it dry.":`轻敲上半部并取下，然后把浴球倒在手上晾干。`,"Tapers the walls so the formed sheet lets go of the buck":`给侧壁加上拔模角，让成型片材能从阳模上脱下`,Text:`文字`,"That spot isn’t on the model.":`那个位置不在模型上。`,"The SVG has no filled shapes or lines to make a logo from.":`这个 SVG 没有可用来做标志的填充形状或线条。`,"The SVG’s drawing is flat: it has no height or width.":`这个 SVG 的图形是扁平的：没有高度或宽度。`,"The ZIP has a README.txt with the assembly and pour order and the material amounts.":`ZIP 中有一个 README.txt，写明组装和浇注顺序以及材料用量。`,"The base piece’s plane doesn’t cross the model, so the mold has no base piece.":`底块所在平面没有穿过模型，因此模具没有底块。`,"The bottom":`底部`,"The cast gets a hole where the pour hole meets it (trim the spare off there).":`铸件在浇注孔接触的位置会有一个孔（在那里切掉冒口）。`,"The file contains no triangles.":`文件中没有三角形。`,"The font “{name}” isn’t loaded.":`字体“{name}”未加载。`,"The hinge lines the halves up, so the shell has no keys; hold it shut with tape or a strap.":`铰链会对齐两半，因此外壳没有定位键；用胶带或绑带保持闭合。`,"The hinged shell prints lying open, in one go: its pin prints inside the knuckles. Work the hinge gently to free it before first use.":`带铰链的外壳展开状态一次打印完成：铰链轴直接打印在转节里面。首次使用前轻轻活动铰链让它松开。`,"The holes are a little wider than the bolt, so it slides through (M4: 4.5 mm)":`孔比螺栓稍大，螺栓可以顺利穿过（M4：4.5 mm）`,"The inside narrows toward the opening, so the core is straightened to lift out: the cast’s wall gets {volume} thicker below the narrowing.":`内腔朝开口方向收窄，因此型芯被拉直以便取出：收窄处以下铸件壁厚增加 {volume}。`,"The label “{text}”":`标签“{text}”`,"The lip lines the halves up and keeps dust out; snap bumps also click it shut":`唇边能对齐两半并防尘；卡扣还能把它扣紧`,"The logo":`标志`,"The master is too thin to hollow at that shell thickness.":`母模太薄，无法按该外壳厚度掏空。`,"The model as a buck to vacuum-form plastic sheet over: drafted, on a plinth, with vent holes where air would be trapped.":`把模型作为真空吸塑阳模：带拔模角，放在底座上，在会困住空气的地方开排气孔。`,"The model has no peak with a straight way out through the die floor, so there are no release holes.":`模型没有能直通压模底部的峰点，因此没有顶出孔。`,"The model has no volume — is it a flat surface or a single sheet?":`模型没有体积 —— 它是一个平面还是一层薄片？`,"The model hollowed to a wall":`掏空到一定壁厚的模型`,"The model is empty.":`模型为空。`,"The model is not a closed solid ({status}).":`模型不是闭合实体（{status}）。`,"The model is too small for a piston with this clearance.":`模型太小，无法以此间隙放置压头。`,"The model is too thin to hollow to that wall thickness: try a thinner wall.":`模型太薄，无法掏空到该壁厚：请尝试更薄的壁。`,"The model only touches the base on a small area: turn on Seal to base (Master preparation) so silicone can’t run underneath it.":`模型只有一小块面积接触底面：请打开“与底面密封”（母模处理），防止硅胶流到下面。`,"The model only touches the parting face on a small area, so the first half wraps under it. This mold suits flat-backed pieces best; otherwise try 2-Part Silicone.":`模型只有一小块面积接触分模面，因此第一半会包住它的底面。此模具最适合平背零件；否则请试试两件式硅胶模。`,"The model’s base is too small for locating pins; glue it to the base plate instead.":`模型底面太小，放不下定位销；请改为把它粘在底板上。`,"The model’s bottom has no room for feet that wide.":`模型底部没有空间放这么宽的底脚。`,"The model’s own (open at the top)":`模型自身的内腔（顶部开口）`,"The mold wall follows the model’s size, so a small model takes less plastic. Turn it off to set the wall yourself.":`模具壁厚随模型大小而定，小模型用的塑料更少。关闭后可自行设置壁厚。`,"The opening is only as big as the model’s base: give it a flat base (Foundation or Seal to base in Master preparation), or use the Direct-Print Mold.":`开口只有模型底面那么大：给它一个平底（母模处理中的“底座加固”或“与底面密封”），或改用直接打印模具。`,"The outline comes in several pieces, so bars across the top join them into one cutter.":`轮廓由几块组成，因此顶部的连接条把它们连成一个切模。`,"The outline is too narrow for a stamp inside the cutter.":`轮廓太窄，切模内放不下印章。`,"The parting plane was steeper than {deg}°, so the mold splits horizontally instead.":`分模面倾斜超过 {deg}°，因此改为水平分模。`,"The parts are where they sit in the assembled mold: turn them onto a flat side before printing.":`零件处于组装模具中的位置：打印前请把它们翻到平面朝下。`,"The pockets need a plate of {w} × {d} mm, so it was made that big.":`穴位需要 {w} × {d} mm 的板，因此板被做成这么大。`,"The pour hole is wider than the top of the model: make it smaller, or it changes the shape there.":`浇注孔比模型顶部还宽：请调小，否则会改变那里的形状。`,"The printed master is hollow ({volume} less to print), with {n} drain hole(s) in its base: seal them before molding unless the base plate covers them.":`打印的母模是空心的（少打印 {volume}），底部有 {n} 个排空孔：翻模前请封住，除非底板会盖住它们。`,"The printed master is hollow ({volume} less to print).":`打印的母模是空心的（少打印 {volume}）。`,"The rim (a vessel open at the top)":`口沿（顶部开口的器皿）`,"The rim is too narrow for alignment keys.":`边缘太窄，放不下定位键。`,"The rim is too narrow for the overflow ring: widen the rim.":`边缘太窄，放不下溢料环：请加宽边缘。`,"The shell is short for a hinge: the knuckles are narrow, so work it gently.":`外壳太短，不适合做铰链：转节很窄，请轻轻操作。`,"The shell is too small or its wall too thin for stacking sockets.":`外壳太小或壁太薄，放不下堆叠插孔。`,"The shell is too thin at the split for the magnets’ height.":`外壳在分模处太薄，放不下这个高度的磁铁。`,"The side split planes leave too wide a gap between them for pieces round the model, so only the first is used: spread them round it.":`侧向分模面之间的空隙太大，无法做成围绕模型的石膏块，所以只用第一个：请把它们分布在模型四周。`,"The silicone thickness follows the model’s size, so a small model takes less silicone. Turn it off to set the thickness yourself.":`硅胶厚度随模型大小而定，小模型用的硅胶更少。关闭后可自行设置厚度。`,"The spare height and plaster wall follow the model’s size, so a small piece takes less plaster. Turn it off to set them yourself.":`冒口高度和石膏壁厚随模型大小而定，小件用的石膏更少。关闭后可自行设置。`,"The split doesn’t cross the model, so one half holds all of it.":`分模没有穿过模型，因此一半就包含了整个模型。`,"The split is too close to the top for a lip, so the halves are lined up with keys instead.":`分模离顶部太近，放不下唇边，因此改用定位键对齐两半。`,"The split plane doesn’t cross the model, so one half holds all of it.":`分模面没有穿过模型，因此一半就包含了整个模型。`,"The split plane doesn’t cross the model, so one part holds all of it.":`分模面没有穿过模型，因此一个零件就包含了整个模型。`,"The top":`顶部`,"The top (funnel on the highest point)":`顶部（漏斗在最高点）`,"The vents around the foot need a plinth to run through; set a plinth height.":`底脚一圈的排气孔需要穿过底座；请设置底座高度。`,"The volume label":`用量标签`,"The volume label goes on a mold part.":`用量标签要放在模具零件上。`,"The wall ends sit in a groove in the base plate":`盒壁的端部插在底板的槽里`,"The wall must be at least {mm} mm for a lip, so the halves are lined up with keys instead.":`壁厚至少要 {mm} mm 才能做唇边，因此改用定位键对齐两半。`,"The wall must be at least {mm} mm to fill from below, so the mold is filled from the top.":`壁厚至少要 {mm} mm 才能从下方灌注，因此改为从上方灌注。`,"The −X −Y corner stays square and marked, to push against the machine’s stops; positions are measured from it":`−X −Y 角保持直角并做标记，用来顶住机床挡块；位置都从这里量起`,"There is no room for a core inside the model.":`模型内部没有空间放型芯。`,"Thicker walls take up more water and cast more pieces before they need drying":`壁越厚吸水越多，需要干燥前能浇注的件数也越多`,"Thickness of the case walls, and of the floors where they are hollowed out":`外箱壁的厚度，以及底部挖空处的厚度`,"This is not a MoldForge project file.":`这不是 MoldForge 项目文件。`,"This model could not be repaired into a closed solid. Try fixing it in Meshmixer, PrusaSlicer (“Fix model”) or Blender (3D-Print Toolbox) first.":`此模型无法修复为闭合实体。请先在 Meshmixer、PrusaSlicer（“Fix model”）或 Blender（3D-Print Toolbox）中修复。`,"This model could not be repaired into a closed solid: {n} open edges could not be closed automatically. Try fixing it in Meshmixer, PrusaSlicer (“Fix model”) or Blender (3D-Print Toolbox) first.":`此模型无法修复为闭合实体：有 {n} 条开放边无法自动闭合。请先在 Meshmixer、PrusaSlicer（“Fix model”）或 Blender（3D-Print Toolbox）中修复。`,"This project file is incomplete.":`此项目文件不完整。`,"This project was saved by a newer version of MoldForge.":`此项目由更新版本的 MoldForge 保存。`,"Through the die floor at the deepest points: air escapes while pressing, and a pin pushes the piece out":`在压模底部最深处开孔：压制时空气由此排出，并可用销子把零件顶出`,"Ticked parts are shown and go into the download.":`勾选的零件会显示并加入下载。`,Tilt:`倾斜`,"Tilt direction":`倾斜方向`,"Tilt the parting surface to follow the model":`倾斜分模面以贴合模型`,"Tin-cure silicone, 100:5":`锡固化硅胶，100:5`,"To stack shells, push a stacking pin into each socket on top of the lower shell and set the next one on them.":`堆叠保护盒时，在下层保护盒顶部的每个插孔插入一根堆叠销，再把上一层放上去。`,"Tongue & groove seams":`榫槽接缝`,"Top half":`上半部`,"Tray Box":`托盘盒`,Triangles:`三角形`,"Trim flange":`修边边缘`,"Trim line":`修边线`,"Trim line groove":`修边线槽`,"Try a sample:":`试试示例：`,"Try it on the {sample} sample":`用示例“{sample}”试试`,"Turn each silicone case mold over. Mix and pour the plaster for each piece, level it with the top and tap out the bubbles: {pieces}.":`把每个硅胶外箱模翻过来。为每块调配并浇注石膏，刮平与边缘齐平，轻敲排出气泡：{pieces}。`,"Turn the box over and lift off the base plate and the spacer: the master’s underside now lies flush in the silicone.":`把盒子翻过来，取下底板和垫块：母模底面现在与硅胶齐平。`,"Turn the box over and move the base plate to the other end: the walls reach past the silicone at both ends.":`把盒子翻过来，把底板装到另一端：盒壁在两端都超出硅胶。`,"Turn the box over, take off the base plate and the parting insert, and brush mold release onto the silicone’s parting face and keys.":`把盒子翻过来，取下底板和分模垫件，在硅胶的分模面和定位键上刷脱模剂。`,"Turn the die over, opening up, and fill it to the top with loose material ({cast} per piece once pressed).":`把压模翻过来开口朝上，用松散材料装满到顶（压制后每件 {cast}）。`,"Turn the mold over and pour through the opening; the cast comes out the same way.":`翻转模具从开口浇注；铸件也从同一处取出。`,"Turn the mold over so its opening faces up.":`把模具翻过来让开口朝上。`,"Turn the mold slowly every way (by hand or on the rotocaster) until the material has set, so it coats the whole inside.":`向各个方向缓慢转动模具（手动或用旋转浇铸机），直到材料凝固，让它覆盖整个内腔。`,"Turns where the walls split":`旋转盒壁的分开位置`,"Two cups that follow the model, with a rim, alignment keys and an overflow ring for a clean seam.":`两个随模型外形的杯体，带边缘、定位键和溢料环，让接缝干净。`,"Two vertical (X + Y)":`两个竖直 (X + Y)`,"Typical densities; check your product’s data sheet. Amounts include the extra below.":`典型密度；请查看产品技术资料。用量已包含下方余量。`,Undercuts:`倒扣`,"Undercuts removed":`已去除倒扣`,"Undercuts were filled so the bomb drops out of both halves.":`已填平倒扣，让浴球能从两半中脱出。`,"Undercuts were filled so the formed sheet comes off the buck.":`已填平倒扣，让成型片材能从阳模上脱下。`,"Undercuts were filled so the pressed piece comes out of the die.":`已填平倒扣，让压制件能从压模中脱出。`,"Undercuts: none found in that direction.":`倒扣：该方向上没有发现。`,"Underside angle":`底面角度`,Undo:`撤销`,"Undo (Ctrl+Z)":`撤销 (Ctrl+Z)`,"Unsupported file type “.{ext}”. Use STL, OBJ, 3MF or PLY.":`不支持的文件类型“.{ext}”。请使用 STL、OBJ、3MF 或 PLY。`,"Use your model as the master.":`用你的模型作为母模。`,"Uses the outline seen from above, so lay the model flat, face up. Turn on the stamp to press its relief into the dough too.":`使用从上方看到的轮廓，所以请把模型正面朝上放平。打开印章可把它的浮雕也印到面团上。`,"Vacuum-Forming Buck":`真空吸塑阳模`,"Vent channels":`排气通道`,"Vent holes":`排气孔`,"Vent pins":`排气杆`,"Vent Ø":`排气孔 Ø`,Vents:`排气孔`,"Vents round the foot":`底脚一圈的排气孔`,"Vertical (X)":`竖直 (X)`,"Vertical (Y)":`竖直 (Y)`,Volume:`体积`,"Volume label":`用量标签`,"Wall above the blade":`刃口以上的壁厚`,"Wall around the pockets":`穴位四周的壁厚`,"Wall pieces":`盒壁块数`,"Wall steps":`壁的级数`,"Wall thickened from {from} to {to} mm so the bolt holes fit. Pick a smaller bolt or turn Bolt holes off to keep it at {from} mm.":`壁厚已从 {from} mm 加到 {to} mm，以便放下螺栓孔。要保持 {from} mm，请选更小的螺栓或关闭螺栓孔。`,"Wall thickened from {from} to {to} mm so the seal ring fits. Turn Seal ring off to keep it at {from} mm.":`壁厚已从 {from} mm 加到 {to} mm，以便放下密封环。要保持 {from} mm，请关闭密封环。`,"Wall thickened from {from} to {to} mm so the sprue fits in it beside the model. Fill from the top to keep it at {from} mm.":`壁厚已从 {from} mm 加到 {to} mm，以便在模型旁的壁内放下浇道。要保持 {from} mm，请改为从上方灌注。`,"Wall thickness":`壁厚`,"Wall too thin for alignment keys.":`壁太薄，放不下对齐键。`,"Wall too thin for registration keys.":`壁太薄，放不下定位键。`,"Walls and flanges too narrow for a tongue & groove seam; widen the flange.":`盒壁和法兰太窄，做不了榫槽接缝；请加宽法兰。`,Water:`水`,"Water per 100 parts plaster":`每 100 份石膏的水量`,Wax:`蜡`,"What you prepare here is what gets cast.":`在这里处理的就是最终浇注的形状。`,"When the wall is thick enough (check at the spare: often 10 to 20 minutes), pour the slip back out and let the mold drain upside down.":`壁厚足够时（在冒口处检查：通常 10 到 20 分钟），把泥浆倒回，并把模具倒置沥干。`,"Widens the bucket so every part comes straight off the cast":`加宽桶，让每块都能直接从铸件上取下`,"Widens the cavity so each half pulls straight off":`加宽型腔，让每一半都能直接取下`,"Widens the cavity so every part pulls straight off":`加宽型腔，让每个零件都能直接取下`,"Widens the outer mold so every part pulls straight off the skin":`加宽外模，让每块都能直接从表皮上取下`,base:`底块`,"built-in":`内置`,"casting material":`浇注材料`,cm:`cm`,inch:`英寸`,m:`m`,master:`母模`,mm:`mm`,"or drop it anywhere":`或拖放到任意位置`,preview:`预览`,"shrunk to {size} mm to fit":`已缩小到 {size} mm 以放得下`,"side {letter}":`侧块 {letter}`,"the master":`母模`,"{g} of {material} ({ml} cm³)":`{g} {material}（{ml} cm³）`,"{label} doesn’t fit on any free face of the mold: make it smaller or place it by hand.":`{label}在模具上找不到可放的空闲面：请缩小或手动放置。`,"{label} is no longer on {part}: place it again.":`{label}已不在{part}上：请重新放置。`,"{label} runs off the edge of {part}.":`{label}超出了{part}的边缘。`,"{label} was on a part this mold doesn’t have, so it is placed automatically.":`{label}原本在此模具没有的零件上，因此改为自动放置。`,"{label}: these characters aren’t in the font and are left out: {chars}":`{label}：字体中没有这些字符，已省略：{chars}`,"{label}: {amount}":`{label}：{amount}`,"{name} fits the model as it is: put the label on one of its parts.":`{name}直接贴合模型：请把标签放在它的某个零件上。`,"{n} built-in":`{n} 个内置`,"{n} funnel(s)":`{n} 个漏斗`,"{n} key(s)":`{n} 个定位键`,"{n} label(s)":`{n} 个标签`,"{n} on":`已开启 {n} 项`,"{n} pillar(s)":`{n} 根支柱`,"{n} screw hole(s) left out where they would run into a dowel hole: make the plate deeper.":`已省略 {n} 个会碰到定位销孔的螺丝孔：请加大板的深度。`,"{n} split plane(s)":`{n} 个分模面`,"{n} vent(s)":`{n} 个排气孔`,"{n} warning(s)":`{n} 条警告`,"{part} came out empty and was skipped.":`{part}为空，已跳过。`,"{part} consists of several separate pieces.":`{part}由几个分离的块组成。`,"{piece}: {amount}":`{piece}：{amount}`,"{p} of plaster in {w} of water":`{p} 石膏兑 {w} 水`,"{step}: added {volume}.":`{step}：增加了 {volume}。`,"{system} fits the model as it is, so labels on the master are left out.":`{system}直接贴合模型，因此母模上的标签已省略。`,"{system} only uses the model’s outside, so its hollow inside is ignored.":`{system}只用到模型外表，因此忽略其空心内部。`,"{system} settings":`{system} 设置`,"{system} · generated {date}":`{system} · 生成于 {date}`,"{total} of silicone (part A {a} + part B {b})":`{total} 硅胶（A 组分 {a} + B 组分 {b}）`,"{volume} · {mm} mm thick":`{volume} · 厚 {mm} mm`,"⚠ These parts can't be pulled off the cast, because an undercut or a hollow inside of the model locks them in place: {parts}. Try Clear extraction, another split direction or height, or a flexible 2-Part Silicone mold.":`⚠ 以下零件无法从铸件上取下，因为模型的倒扣或空心内部把它们卡住了：{parts}。请尝试“自由脱模”、换一个分模方向或高度，或改用柔性的两件式硅胶模。`,"⚠ These parts can't be pulled off the cast, because an undercut or a hollow inside of the model locks them in place: {parts}. Try another parting height or orientation.":`⚠ 以下零件无法从铸件上取下，因为模型的倒扣或空心内部把它们卡住了：{parts}。请尝试其他分模高度或方向。`,"⚠ These plaster pieces can't be pulled off the cast, because an undercut of the model holds them: {pieces}. Try more pieces, a base piece or Clear extraction.":`⚠ 以下石膏件无法从铸件上取下，因为模型的倒扣卡住了它们：{pieces}。请尝试更多石膏块、增加底块或“自由脱模”。`,"✓ {n} printable part(s) · {s} s":`✓ {n} 个可打印零件 · {s} 秒`,"⤓ Lay flat on face":`⤓ 以面放平`,"⬇ Prepared master (STL) · {v} cm³":`⬇ 处理后的母模（STL）· {v} cm³`,"Per cast":`每次浇注`};export{e as default};